мый повтор формулировки — допустимо, потеря — нет).\n2567:     \"\"\"\n2568: \n\nRANGE 3150 3213\n3150: class _ServeToolState:\n3151:     \"\"\"Накопление native tool lifecycle serve до полного ввода.\"\"\"\n3152: \n3153:     def __init__(self) -> None:\n3154:         self.tools: dict[str, _ToolItem] = {}\n3155:         self.emitted: set[str] = set()\n3156: \n3157:     def feed(self, data: dict[str, object]) -> None:\n3158:         \"\"\"Запомнить фрагмент native вызова.\"\"\"\n3159:         call_id = str(data.get(\"id\") or \"\")\n3160:         if not call_id:\n3161:             return\n3162:         item = self.tools.setdefault(call_id, {\"name\": \"\", \"text\": \"\", \"input\": None})\n3163:         name = data.get(\"name\")\n3164:         if isinstance(name, str) and name:\n3165:             item[\"name\"] = name\n3166:         text_value = data.get(\"text\")\n3167:         if isinstance(text_value, str):\n3168:             item[\"text\"] = text_value\n3169:         input_value = data.get(\"input\")\n3170:         if isinstance(input_value, dict):\n3171:             item[\"input\"] = _as_dict(input_value)\n3172: \n3173:     def complete(\n3174:         self, call_id: str, event_type: str = \"\"\n3175:     ) -> tuple[str, dict[str, object]] | None:\n3176:         \"\"\"Готовый вызов из called.input или input.ended.text; статус — из типа события.\"\"\"\n3177:         if call_id in self.emitted:\n3178:             return None\n3179:         item = self.tools.get(call_id)\n3180:         if item is None or not item[\"name\"]:\n3181:             return None\n3182:         args = item[\"input\"]\n3183:         if not isinstance(args, dict):\n3184:             text_value = item[\"text\"]\n3185:             try:\n3186:                 parsed: object = json.loads(text_value) if text_value else None\n3187:             except ValueError:\n3188:                 return None\n3189:             if not isinstance(parsed, dict):\n3190:                 return None\n3191:         